# `specs.list`

Raw spec records from the DB.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.specs.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`SpecsListResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `items` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call specs.list --json '{}'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "checkout-flow",
      "title": "Checkout service end-to-end",
      "body_path": ".ship/specs/checkout-flow.md",
      "status": "launched",
      "pipeline": "ship-feature",
      "agent": "rust-lane",
      "vars": {
        "area": "platform"
      },
      "criteria": [
        "Service scaffolded",
        "Happy-path contract test passes"
      ],
      "scope": [
        "crates/core/ship-platform"
      ],
      "priority": 1,
      "created_at": "2026-05-24T12:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-05-24T18:00:00Z"
    }
  ]
}
```
